  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Screening a forward/reverse PCR primer pair against editable limits for length, GC%, Primer3 Tm, hairpin/dimer Tm, homopolymer runs, Tm difference and 3' GC count, under chosen reaction conditions, with an optional exact-amplicon check on a pasted template and JSON/HTML reports to keep with lab records. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
